      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Haven't You Heard? I'm Sakamoto (坂本ですが? , Sakamoto desu ga? , lit. \"I'm Sakamoto, You Know?\") is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Nami Sano. The manga follows a high school student named Sakamoto, who has a reputation for being the \"coolest\" person among the entire student body. The series has been licensed for an English release by Seven Seas Entertainment. An anime television adaptation by Studio Deen aired between April 8, 2016 and July 1, 2016.",
